      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better. the math doesn't work out. every month i'm not working enough, the debt gets bigger, the stress on her gets higher... it's like i'm actively pulling them under. if i just disappeared, the insurance or whatever would at least cover the gap, and they wouldnt have to watch me fail every single day. it honestly feels more like a gift to them if i'm not here to make it worse.",
